# Build context of deploy/fastapi/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the
# Dockerfile instead of the root .dockerignore). Allowlist: exclude everything, then add back only
# what the image needs. .git, .venv, data/, results/, models/, notebooks, PLAN.md and CLAUDE.md
# therefore never reach the Docker daemon.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src/
!deploy/fastapi/app.py
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
